OL,3,GNEWSACan big events change how a city
OL,4,Ais seen?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of people have descended on
OL,7,FSouthampton for concerts, festivals and
OL,8,Fmajor events this summer, but can they
OL,9,Fchange the way the city is seen?
OL,11,FFrom major artists performing in
OL,12,FGuildhall Square to hundreds of
OL,13,Fmusicians taking over venues across
OL,14,FSouthampton, the city has had a packed
OL,15,Fevents calendar.
OL,17,FIt comes four years after Southampton
OL,18,Freached the final four in the race to
OL,19,Fbecome UK City of Culture, with council
OL,20,Fleaders subsequently pledging to build
OL,21,Fon the momentum of the bid.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
